Scenario: View Approved Process Notification With Comments
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin edit Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin goto Progress Step
		|kfProgressName|Workflow|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin edit Workflow
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Single Approver|
		|workflowDefinitionTitleEdit|Edited Workflow Definition|
	And KaleoDesigner select Node
		|nodeNodeLabel|review|
	And KaleoDesigner edit Node Notifications
		|nodeNotificationsDescription|Review Notification Description|
		|nodeNotificationsExecutionType|On Exit|
		|nodeNotificationsName|Review Completed With Comments User Notification|
		|nodeNotificationsTemplate||
		|nodeNotificationsTemplateLanguage|Velocity|
		|nodeNotificationsType|User Notification|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin publish Workflow
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Workflow
		|edit|true|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Edited Workflow Definition|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin assign Form
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowTask|create|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin view Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow view Default My Workflow Tasks CP
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin submit New Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin populate Field Text
		|fieldName|Text|
		|kfProcessFieldData|Test 1|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Process Record
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowAssetType|${workflowAssetType}|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowActivityComment|Process is approved|
		|workflowAssetTitle|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowAssetType|${workflowAssetType}|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Notifications|
	Then WorkflowAsset view Notification
		|contentBody|Submission reviewed. The reviewer left the following: Process is approved.|

